5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since this is the first day, we have no concrete information. I suggest we use this time to observe each other's communication styles and logical patterns. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to propose?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I don't have a fancy strategy, but I'll be watching everyone. If anyone tries to act too sneaky or lie to us, I'll be the first one to call them out! Let's just be honest.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to play with everyone! I agree with Takumi—let's just be honest and friendly! I'll be keeping my eyes wide open for any clues. This is going to be such a fun mystery!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Honesty is a pleasant sentiment, but it's hardly a strategy in a game of deception. I'll be observing the gaps in your logic and how you react to pressure. Let's see who maintains their composure.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. Since we lack information, observation is our best tool. Let's maintain a civil dialogue and see how everyone's narrative evolves. I'm interested to see who tries to lead the group too early.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi and @Mio, your enthusiasm is noted, but remember that the werewolf will also try to appear friendly. @Shion, @Minako, I agree that composure and narrative control are key indicators. Let's see who mirrors whom.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio"",""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Mirroring? I don't know about that, but I'm not copying anyone! I'm just being me. @Asuka, you're acting like a teacher. I'll just trust my gut and keep a close eye on everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, you're so sharp! I'll try my best not to mirror anyone, though I do really like how everyone is thinking. I'm just here to help us find the wolf! Who do you think is the most suspicious so far?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, asking for a suspect this early is premature. It's a common tactic to deflect attention by forcing others to name names. I'm more interested in who is trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, you make a valid point. Forcing a suspect now would be baseless. I believe we should focus on the flow of the conversation. @Mio, let's hold off on suspicions until we have actual evidence to analyze.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, @Minako, I agree. We should avoid baseless accusations. However, I am curious about the Seer's approach. @everyone, do you believe the Seer should reveal themselves early to guide us, or remain hidden for safety?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"The Seer should stay hidden! If they come out now, the wolf will just eat them tonight. We have to protect the Seer so they can keep finding the wolf for us!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree with Takumi! The Seer is like our secret weapon, so we have to keep them safe and sound. I'll do my best to protect them! I wonder who the Seer is? Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"The Seer's safety is indeed paramount, but total silence can be a waste of a powerful asset. A strategic reveal, timed perfectly, can dismantle the wolf's narrative. For now, however, discretion is the only logical choice.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"I concur with Shion. While the Seer's safety is vital, the timing of their revelation will be the deciding factor in our success. For now, let us all remain vigilant and wait for the first night's results.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,It seems we have reached a consensus on the Seer's discretion and our general approach of observation. I will be analyzing the consistency of everyone's statements tomorrow. Let us conclude for today.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm done for today! I'll be thinking hard about everything everyone said. Good luck to the Seer tonight—stay safe and find that wolf! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'm over too! I hope everyone has a wonderful night's sleep. Good luck to the Seer—I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow! Bye-bye everyone!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I shall retire now. I look forward to seeing whose mask begins to crack once the first piece of truth is revealed tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. We have a solid foundation for our observations. I shall spend the night reflecting on our initial interactions. I wish you all a peaceful evening. Goodnight.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
