36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Good morning. The first night has passed, and the Seer now has their first result. If anyone is willing to share their findings or has noticed any suspicious patterns, please speak. Let's be cautious but decisive.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm awake! @Seer, if you found the wolf, you should tell us! But if you're not sure, just be careful. I've been thinking, and I'm still watching everyone to see who's acting weird today!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning everyone! I hope you all slept well! I'm so curious about what the Seer found. @Seer, if you have a clue that can help us, please let us know! I'm ready to help!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"It is far too early for the Seer to be pressured into a reveal. Such eagerness, @Takumi, @Mio, only serves the werewolf by exposing our most valuable asset. I, however, have a clear view of the board.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, I agree. Pressuring the Seer is counterproductive. However, if the Seer feels the village is ready to act on their information, we should be open to it. Does anyone have a specific reason to be suspicious today?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your insistence on protecting the Seer is logical, but your claim to have a ""clear view of the board"" is vague. Are you implying you have information, or are you simply analyzing our behavior?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, what does that even mean? ""Clear view of the board""? You sound like you're hiding something! If you know who the wolf is, just say it instead of acting all mysterious!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so funny! But @Shion, you do sound a bit like a movie character! Are you the Seer, or just really good at reading people? I'm getting so excited to find out!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, I am analyzing the patterns. @Takumi, your impatience is a liability; reacting emotionally makes you easy to manipulate. As for @Mio, my ""character"" is simply a preference for precision over noise. I'll reveal my hand when it's most effective.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, while precision is valuable, being overly cryptic can sometimes be mistaken for evasion. @Takumi, please try to remain calm; emotional reactions only muddy the waters. Let us focus on whether anyone is actually claiming a role.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your refusal to be direct is becoming a pattern. While you advocate for logic, you are the only one avoiding a clear answer. If you are not the Seer, your cryptic nature is an inefficient way to build trust.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, you're just dodging the question! First you act all mysterious, and now you're calling me emotional just because I'm calling you out. That's exactly what a wolf would do to make me look bad! Just tell us who you are!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, don't get too upset! But @Shion, it is a little bit spooky how you're avoiding the question. If you're not the Seer, why be so mysterious? It's making me a little nervous! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, @Mio, your nervousness is a predictable reaction to a lack of control. I am not dodging; I am calculating. If I reveal my role now, I simply provide the wolf with a target. I prefer to let you expose yourselves first.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, your desire to let others expose themselves is a bold strategy, but it is creating a vacuum of trust. While I value your calculation, the village needs a direction. If no one claims the Seer role, we are voting blindly.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your strategy of ""calculating"" while remaining opaque is actively hindering the village's progress. By refusing to provide a clear role or a lead, you are creating the very instability a werewolf thrives on. I suspect your behavior is a mask.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, I've had enough of your games! You're just hiding behind big words to confuse us. If you're not the Seer, you're definitely the wolf trying to trick us. I'm voting for you!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, it's really sad that everyone is getting so angry! I don't want us to fight, but @Takumi and @Asuka make a good point. Being so mysterious is a bit scary! I'll follow the group's lead.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, @Asuka, your haste to execute me based on a personality clash is precisely the lack of logic I anticipated. I am the Seer. I have confirmed Minako is human. Now, do you wish to continue this emotional outburst or actually win?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, thank you for the confirmation. While the timing of your reveal was unconventional, having a confirmed human provides the village with a necessary anchor. @Takumi, @Asuka, let us now prioritize this information over our impressions.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
