68,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Wait, what?! Shion was the Seer? I can't believe we just killed the only person who could find the wolf! And now Asuka is gone too! This is terrible! Who is the wolf? They're just laughing at us!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Mio,,Oh no! This is a total nightmare! I can't believe we actually executed the Seer... I feel so bad! And Asuka is gone too? I'm actually shaking right now! Who could be so mean to do this to us?,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a devastating loss. Executing the Seer and losing Asuka in one night has left us in a critical position. We must stop panicking and analyze the facts. @Takumi, @Mio, please compose yourselves so we can think clearly.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm trying to be calm, but this is a disaster! Shion said Minako is human, so we can trust her for now. That means the wolf is either Mio or me! @Mio, why are you acting so scared? Are you trying to trick us?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minako"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, that's so mean! I'm scared because we're losing everyone! I'm just a regular girl, I'm not a wolf! Why would I act scared if I were the bad guy? I'd probably be acting all calm like Shion was!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, @Mio, let us avoid accusations based on emotional displays. Shion's confirmation of my humanity is the only concrete fact we have. If we are to find the werewolf, we must look at the logic of the attacks.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, you're right, but we're out of time! If you're human, then it's just me and Mio. If I'm not the wolf, then Mio has to be! @Mio, stop crying and tell me why you're the wolf! I'm not letting the wolf win!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, stop it! I'm not crying, I'm just really upset! How can you be so sure it's me? You're the one acting all aggressive and scary now! @Minako, please tell him to stop! I'm just a human!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, your aggression is not helping us reach a logical conclusion. @Mio, please stay calm. If we are to identify the werewolf among the three of us, we must evaluate who benefits most from the current chaos.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, I'm not just being aggressive, I'm trying to save us! If you're human, the wolf is right here. @Mio, your ""scared girl"" act is too perfect! I'm not backing down until the wolf is gone!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're being so scary! I can't believe you're blaming me just because I'm upset! @Minako, please help me! I'm just a regular human, I promise! I don't want the wolf to win either!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, @Mio, please listen. We are down to three players. If we execute an innocent person, the werewolf wins immediately. @Takumi, your certainty is dangerous. @Mio, your distress is noted. I will cast my vote based on who is most likely manipulating this situation.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
